This product bundles, as separately-replaceable components, the Apron numerical
abstract domain library and the GMP bindings:

  - fr.inria.apron:apron  (lib-repo/, lib/libjapron.so)
  - fr.inria.apron:gmp    (lib-repo/, lib/libjgmp.so)

MODIFICATIONS. As required by the LGPL, note that these files are NOT the
upstream releases. They are built from a locally patched japron fork, and the
build outputs were further normalised for reproducibility: the Java classes are
emitted at class-file version 61 (Java 17) with fixed archive timestamps, and
the ELF .comment section was stripped from the shared objects. None of this
changes the libraries' behaviour or their licence terms. Their upstream sources
remain available at the address below.

Apron and GMP are licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License (LGPL).
See https://antoinemine.github.io/Apron/doc/ for their upstream sources and
licences. They are loaded dynamically (JNI); to use a different build, replace
the jars in lib-repo/ and the native libraries in lib/.
